<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Technik Net GmbH — Brand Identity, Rev 4</title>
<meta name="description" content="Brand identity system for Technik Net GmbH, Essen — fibre installation contractor, NE3 to NE5.">
<link rel="icon" href="assets/icon-blue-on-white.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="assets/icon-white-on-blue.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400..800&family=SUSE:wght@100..900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ============================================================
   TECHNIK NET — BRAND IDENTITY SYSTEM PAGE · REV 4
   ------------------------------------------------------------
   BRAND VALUES (client-locked — do not change without approval)
     --blue   #0099CC
     --grey   #CCCCCC
     --white  #FFFFFF

   DERIVED VALUES (not brand colours — text/UI only, same hue
   family as --blue). Swap any of these on one line.
     --ink, --ink-soft, --hairline, --tint, --night, --blue-press
   ============================================================ */
:root{
  /* --- brand --- */
  --blue:#0099cc;
  --grey:#cccccc;
  --white:#ffffff;

  /* --- derived --- */
  --ink:#0a2733;          /* body copy, deep shade of --blue      */
  --ink-soft:#5b6f78;     /* secondary copy                        */
  --hairline:#e3e8ea;     /* 1 px rules — tint of --grey on white  */
  --tint:#f5f8f9;         /* faint card ground                     */
  --night:#06171f;        /* hero / dark surfaces                  */
  --blue-press:#0086b5;   /* hover + pressed state of --blue       */

  --shell:1180px;
  --u:15.386;             /* logo construction module, in viewBox units */
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  margin:0;background:var(--white);color:var(--ink);
  font-family:'SUSE',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
  font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
/* ambient tone-on-tone ground — must stay near-invisible */
body::before{
  content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-2;pointer-events:none;
  background:url('assets/pattern-light.webp') repeat;
  background-size:440px 440px;opacity:.85;
}
h1,h2,h3,.node-index,.sample-sora{
  font-family:'Sora',system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.08;margin:0
}
.mono,.node-eyebrow,.scroll-text,.swatch-hex,.tag,.caption,.plate-label,
.type-label,.type-meta,figcaption,.band-meta,.rank-n{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-weight:400
}
p{margin:0}
img,svg{display:block;max-width:100%}
::selection{background:var(--blue);color:var(--white)}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:2px}

.shell{max-width:var(--shell);margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;width:100%}

/* ============ HERO ============ */
.hero{position:relative;background:var(--night)}
.hero-video-wrap{
  position:relative;width:100%;isolation:isolate;
  background:var(--night) url('assets/pattern-night.webp') repeat;
  background-size:440px 440px;
}
.hero-video-wrap video{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
/* Unifies the existing footage into the new palette: hue + saturation
   come from --blue, luminosity stays from the video. Kills the orange. */
.video-tint{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--blue);mix-blend-mode:color;pointer-events:none}
.video-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,transparent 62%,rgba(6,23,31,.72));pointer-events:none}
@supports not (mix-blend-mode:color){.video-tint{display:none}}

.scroll-cue{
  position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:26px;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:2;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;
  opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .8s ease;
}
.scroll-cue.show{opacity:1}
.mouse{
  width:26px;height:42px;border:2px solid var(--white);border-radius:14px;
  position:relative;animation:cueNudge 2.6s ease-in-out infinite
}
.mouse::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;left:50%;top:8px;width:4px;height:8px;margin-left:-2px;
  border-radius:2px;background:var(--white);
  animation:cueBall 2.6s cubic-bezier(.65,-.55,.25,1.5) infinite
}
.scroll-text{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.66)}
@keyframes cueBall{0%,20%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:1}
  60%{transform:translateY(16px);opacity:0}61%,100%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:0}
  85%,100%{opacity:1}}
@keyframes cueNudge{0%,70%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}80%{transform:translateY(5px)}}

/* ============ BLUE STATEMENT BAND ============ */
.band{background:var(--blue);color:var(--ink);padding:96px 0 100px}
.band-eyebrow{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.28em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);display:block;margin-bottom:22px
}
.band h1{
  color:var(--white);font-size:clamp(31px,4.6vw,56px);max-width:15ch;
  text-wrap:balance
}
.band p{max-width:60ch;margin-top:26px;font-size:17px;color:var(--ink)}
.band p code{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:.92em;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.5);padding:1px 6px;border-radius:3px
}
.band-meta{
  margin-top:40px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.42);
  font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink)
}
.band-lockup{width:min(300px,52%);margin-bottom:40px}

/* ============ SECTIONS ============ */
#timeline-container{position:relative;z-index:0}
.node-section{padding:112px 32px 24px}
.node-eyebrow{
  font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);
  display:block;margin-bottom:6px
}
.node-index{
  font-size:clamp(52px,7vw,86px);line-height:1;
  color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--grey);
  margin-bottom:-4px;display:block;user-select:none
}
.node-section h2{font-size:clamp(27px,3.5vw,42px);margin-top:12px}
.node-section h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}
.section-lede{max-width:64ch;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:18px;font-size:17px}
.divider{height:1px;background:var(--hairline);margin:40px 0 0}

/* ---- 01 concepts ---- */
.concept-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:46px}
.concept-grid>*{min-width:0}
.concept{
  background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:6px;
  padding:26px 24px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  transition:border-color .25s ease,transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease
}
.concept:hover{border-color:var(--blue);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 10px 28px -18px rgba(10,39,51,.5)}
.concept-icon{height:48px;margin-bottom:22px}
.concept-icon img{height:48px;width:48px}
.concept h3{font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:9px;letter-spacing:0}
.concept p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.6}
.concept .tag{
  margin-top:auto;padding-top:20px;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue)
}

/* ---- 02 colour ---- */
.swatch-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:46px}
.swatch-grid>*{min-width:0}
.swatch{border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--white)}
.swatch-chip{height:128px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline)}
.swatch-body{padding:16px 18px 20px}
.swatch-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px}
.swatch-hex{font-size:12px;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.06em}
.swatch-role{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:9px;line-height:1.55}
.swatch.is-derived .swatch-hex{color:var(--ink-soft)}

.rank{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:44px}
.rank-item{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:6px}
.rank-n{font-size:12px;color:var(--blue);padding-top:2px}
.rank-item h3{font-size:14.5px;margin-bottom:5px}
.rank-item p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.55}

.hierarchy{margin-top:34px}
.hierarchy-bar{display:flex;height:56px;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--hairline)}
.hierarchy-bar span{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em
}
.note{
  margin-top:24px;padding:20px 24px;border-left:3px solid var(--blue);
  background:var(--tint);color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14.5px;max-width:78ch
}
.note strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.note + .note{margin-top:12px;border-left-color:var(--grey)}

/* ---- 03 type ---- */
.type-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:46px}
.type-grid>*{min-width:0}
.type-card{background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:6px;padding:30px}
.type-label{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:20px}
.sample-sora{font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,46px);line-height:1.14;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--ink)}
.sample-sora.w400{font-weight:400}.sample-sora.w600{font-weight:600}.sample-sora.w800{font-weight:800}
.sample-suse{font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:6px}
.sample-suse.w300{font-weight:300}.sample-suse.w400{font-weight:400}.sample-suse.w600{font-weight:600}
.type-meta{margin-top:20px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--hairline);
  font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);letter-spacing:.05em}
.type-wordmark{
  grid-column:1 / -1;background:var(--tint);border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:6px;
  padding:46px 40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap
}
.type-wordmark img{width:min(420px,54%)}
.type-wordmark .tw-note{max-width:38ch;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6}
.type-wordmark .tw-note strong{color:var(--ink)}

/* ---- 04 construction plate ---- */
.plate{margin:46px 0 0;border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:6px;background:var(--white);padding:26px}
.plate-stage{
  position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:58.6 / 15.06;
  background-color:var(--white);
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(to right,var(--hairline) 1px,transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(to bottom,var(--hairline) 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:calc(100% / 58.6) calc(100% / 15.06);
}
.plate-clear{
  position:absolute;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;
  border:1px dashed var(--blue);opacity:.45
}
.plate-mark{position:absolute;left:6.826%;top:26.56%;width:86.35%;height:46.88%}
.plate-mark img{width:100%;height:100%}
.plate-mark .g{position:absolute;pointer-events:none}
.plate-mark .g-h{left:-6.8%;right:-6.8%;height:1px;background:var(--blue)}
.plate-mark .g-v{top:-56%;bottom:-56%;width:1px;background:var(--blue);opacity:.55}
.g-cap{top:2%}.g-x{top:29.6%}.g-base{top:99.4%}
.g-split-a{left:64.5%}.g-split-b{left:66.3%}
.plate-label{
  position:absolute;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--blue);background:var(--white);padding:0 5px;white-space:nowrap
}
.plate-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:34px}
.plate-facts>*{min-width:0}
.fact{border-top:2px solid var(--blue);padding-top:14px}
.fact dt{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:6px}
.fact dd{margin:0;font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:22px;color:var(--ink)}
.fact dd small{font-family:'SUSE',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);display:block;margin-top:4px}
figcaption{margin-top:16px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft)}

/* ---- 05 applications ---- */
.app-grid{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:46px;align-items:stretch}
.app-main{
  width:calc((100% - 18px) * 1.3 / 2.3);height:520px;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;
  position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:48px;
  background:var(--white);border:1px solid var(--hairline)
}
.app-side{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px}
.app-card{
  flex:1;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;
  border:1px solid var(--hairline)
}
.app-card.is-night,.app-main.is-night{background:var(--night) url('assets/pattern-night.webp') repeat;background-size:300px 300px;border-color:var(--night)}
.app-card.is-blue{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue)}
.app-card.is-grey{background:var(--grey);border-color:var(--grey)}
.app-card.is-pattern{background:var(--white) url('assets/pattern-display.webp') repeat;background-size:300px 300px}
.app-card img{max-width:76%;height:auto}
.app-card.is-signet img{max-width:none;width:auto;height:62%}
.app-main img{max-width:84%}
.caption{
  position:absolute;left:16px;bottom:12px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft)
}
.app-card.is-night .caption,.app-main.is-night .caption,.app-card.is-blue .caption{color:rgba(255,255,255,.72)}
.app-card.is-grey .caption,.app-card.is-pattern .caption,.pattern-wrap .caption{color:var(--ink)}

.icon-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
.icon-row>*{min-width:0}
.icon-cell{
  border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:6px;padding:26px;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:16px;background:var(--tint)
}
.icon-cell img{width:72px;height:auto;border-radius:10px}
.icon-cell span{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-soft);text-align:center}

/* ---- 06 pattern ---- */
.pattern-row{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:stretch;margin-top:46px}
.pattern-wrap{
  width:calc((100% - 18px) * 1.3 / 2.3);height:520px;
  border:1px solid var(--hairline);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;position:relative
}
.pattern-fill{width:100%;height:100%;background:url('assets/pattern-display.webp') repeat;background-size:420px 420px}
.pattern-side{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:22px}
.pattern-fact{border-left:3px solid var(--blue);padding:4px 0 4px 20px}
.pattern-fact h3{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:6px}
.pattern-fact p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}

/* ============ FIBRE TRACK (signature) ============
   Grey = dark fibre. Blue = lit. The run fills as you scroll. */
.fiber-track{position:absolute;top:0;width:3px;z-index:-1}
.fiber-bg-line{position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:3px;height:100%;background:var(--hairline)}
#verticalLine{
  position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:3px;height:0;
  background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,var(--grey),var(--blue));
  background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:top left;
  box-shadow:0 0 14px 1px rgba(0,153,204,.32);
}
.fiber-node{
  position:absolute;left:-11.5px;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;
  border:5px solid var(--white);background:var(--hairline);
  transform:scale(.6);opacity:.4;
  transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.4),opacity .45s ease,background .45s ease,box-shadow .45s ease
}
.fiber-node.is-on{transform:scale(1);opacity:1}
.fiber-final-node{
  position:absolute;left:-13.5px;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;
  border:5px solid var(--white);background:var(--blue);
  transform:scale(0);opacity:0;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.4),opacity .4s ease
}
.fiber-final-node.is-on{transform:scale(1);opacity:1;box-shadow:0 0 18px 3px rgba(0,153,204,.5)}
.fiber-final-bar{
  position:absolute;right:0;height:5px;width:0;
  background-image:linear-gradient(to left,var(--blue),rgba(0,153,204,.15));
  transition:width .8s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);transition-delay:.4s
}
.timeline-end{height:1px}
@media (max-width:1320px){.fiber-track{display:none}}

/* ============ FOOTER ============ */
footer{background:var(--blue);color:var(--ink);padding:88px 0 72px;text-align:center;margin-top:80px}
footer .f-signet{width:56px;margin:0 auto 26px}
footer .f-lockup{width:min(300px,72%);margin:0 auto 20px}
footer .f-tag{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.22em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:26px
}
footer p{color:var(--ink);font-size:14.5px;max-width:56ch;margin:0 auto}
footer .f-meta{
  margin-top:36px;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;
  letter-spacing:.14em;color:rgba(10,39,51,.72)
}

/* ============ SCROLL TO TOP ============ */
#scrollTop{
  position:fixed;right:28px;bottom:28px;z-index:60;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;
  border:1px solid var(--blue);background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);
  backdrop-filter:blur(6px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
  color:var(--blue);cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(10px);padding:0;
  transition:opacity .3s ease,transform .3s ease,visibility .3s ease,background .25s ease,color .25s ease;
}
#scrollTop.show{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translateY(0)}
#scrollTop:hover{background:var(--blue);color:var(--white)}
#scrollTop svg{width:18px;height:18px;display:block;max-width:none}

/* ============ RESPONSIVE ============ */
@media (max-width:1000px){
  .concept-grid,.swatch-grid,.plate-facts,.icon-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .rank{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .app-grid,.pattern-row{flex-direction:column}
  .app-main{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:686/460;padding:32px}
  .app-side{flex-direction:row}
  .app-card{min-height:190px}
  .pattern-wrap{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1/1}
}
@media (max-width:720px){
  body{font-size:16px}
  .band{padding:64px 0 68px}
  .node-section{padding:76px 24px 14px}
  .concept-grid,.swatch-grid,.type-grid,.plate-facts,.icon-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .app-side{flex-direction:column}
  .type-wordmark{padding:30px 24px;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
  .type-wordmark img{width:88%}
  .plate{padding:16px}
  .plate-label{display:none}
  .scroll-cue{display:none}
  footer{padding:64px 0 56px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  html{scroll-behavior:auto}
  *,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.001ms !important;animation-iteration-count:1 !important;transition-duration:.001ms !important}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ===================== HERO ===================== -->
<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-video-wrap">
    <!-- Current hero film, kept as delivered.
         To switch to the wordmark-free ambient loop instead,
         change the src below to: assets/hero-loop.mp4 -->
    <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" poster="assets/hero-poster.webp"
           aria-label="Technik Net brand film">
      <source src="assets/hero-reveal.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
    <div class="video-tint"></div>
    <div class="video-shade"></div>
    <div class="scroll-cue">
      <div class="mouse"></div>
      <p class="scroll-text">Scroll</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ===================== STATEMENT BAND ===================== -->
<section class="band">
  <div class="shell">
    <img class="band-lockup" src="assets/logo-mono-white.svg" alt="Technik Net GmbH">
    <span class="band-eyebrow">Brand identity system · Revision 4</span>
    <h1>Three values. Only one of them carries meaning.</h1>
    <p>
      Revision 4 fixes the palette at <code>#0099CC</code>, <code>#CCCCCC</code> and
      <code>#FFFFFF</code>. Everything below shows how the mark, the type and the
      surfaces behave once those three values are locked — and where the system
      needs a rule rather than a preference.
    </p>
    <p class="band-meta">Technik Net GmbH · Essen · Fibre installation, NE3 – NE5</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div id="timeline-container">
  <div class="fiber-track" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="fiber-bg-line"></div>
    <div id="verticalLine"></div>
    <div class="fiber-node"></div>
    <div class="fiber-node"></div>
    <div class="fiber-node"></div>
    <div class="fiber-node"></div>
    <div class="fiber-node"></div>
    <div class="fiber-node"></div>
    <div class="fiber-final-bar"></div>
    <div class="fiber-final-node"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============ 01 FOUNDATION ============ -->
  <section class="node-section shell" id="sec-1">
    <span class="node-index">01</span>
    <h2>Where the mark <em>comes from</em>.</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">
      The signet reads as a node field on purpose. A fibre network behaves the same way —
      one source, a splitter, and a run that keeps branching until it reaches a socket.
      Six ideas sit underneath the shape:
    </p>

    <div class="concept-grid">
      <article class="concept">
        <div class="concept-icon"><img src="assets/icon-field.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48"></div>
        <h3>Node field</h3>
        <p>Distributed connection, not a single line. One feed, many terminations —
           the geometry the signet is built from.</p>
        <p class="tag">Signet</p>
      </article>

      <article class="concept">
        <div class="concept-icon"><img src="assets/icon-fibre.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48"></div>
        <h3>Fibre</h3>
        <p>The literal strand — the medium Technik Net pulls, splices and terminates
           on every job, NE3 through NE5.</p>
        <p class="tag">NE3 → NE5</p>
      </article>

      <article class="concept">
        <div class="concept-icon"><img src="assets/icon-node.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48"></div>
        <h3>Splice point</h3>
        <p>Junctions, splice trays, TA sockets. The rounded terminals in the wordmark
           are drawn from the same vocabulary.</p>
        <p class="tag">Splice · TA · Switch</p>
      </article>

      <article class="concept">
        <div class="concept-icon"><img src="assets/icon-infra.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48"></div>
        <h3>Infrastructure</h3>
        <p>Distribution cabinet to Gf-AP OneBox — the layer a network physically
           rides on, all the way to the end user.</p>
        <p class="tag">NE4 · ZTV60</p>
      </article>

      <article class="concept">
        <div class="concept-icon"><img src="assets/icon-lit.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48"></div>
        <h3>Dark and lit</h3>
        <p>Blue is not decoration. It marks the segment that carries light.
           Grey is the same run before handover — dark fibre.</p>
        <p class="tag">Dark → lit</p>
      </article>

      <article class="concept">
        <div class="concept-icon"><img src="assets/icon-applied.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48"></div>
        <h3>Applied</h3>
        <p>How the mark travels off-screen: vehicle livery, hi-vis workwear, site
           signage. Placeholder framing until real photography exists.</p>
        <p class="tag">Pending · photography</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <div class="divider"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 02 COLOUR ============ -->
  <section class="node-section shell" id="sec-2">
    <span class="node-index">02</span>
    <h2>Colour system</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">
      Three values, fixed. They are not interchangeable, and they never appear at
      equal weight in the same frame.
    </p>

    <div class="swatch-grid">
      <div class="swatch">
        <div class="swatch-chip" style="background:#0099cc"></div>
        <div class="swatch-body">
          <p class="swatch-name">Live Blue</p>
          <p class="swatch-hex">#0099CC</p>
          <p class="swatch-role">The only colour that carries meaning: lit fibre, live
             links, the “Net”. Full strength or absent — never tinted.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="swatch">
        <div class="swatch-chip" style="background:#cccccc"></div>
        <div class="swatch-body">
          <p class="swatch-name">Duct Grey</p>
          <p class="swatch-hex">#CCCCCC</p>
          <p class="swatch-role">Structure, not decoration: rules, dividers, dark fibre,
             and the “Technik” half of the wordmark.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="swatch">
        <div class="swatch-chip" style="background:#ffffff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline)"></div>
        <div class="swatch-body">
          <p class="swatch-name">Paper White</p>
          <p class="swatch-hex">#FFFFFF</p>
          <p class="swatch-role">The ground. Holds the largest area on every surface so
             the blue stays an event rather than a wash.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="swatch is-derived">
        <div class="swatch-chip" style="background:#0a2733"></div>
        <div class="swatch-body">
          <p class="swatch-name">Deep Ink <em style="font-style:normal;color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:400">· derived</em></p>
          <p class="swatch-hex">#0A2733</p>
          <p class="swatch-role">Not a brand colour. A dark shade of Live Blue, used only
             for body copy where the three brand values cannot be read.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rank">
      <div class="rank-item">
        <span class="rank-n">01</span>
        <div><h3>Blue leads</h3><p>First in the palette and first in the eye. It picks the
          one thing on a surface that matters.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rank-item">
        <span class="rank-n">02</span>
        <div><h3>Grey separates</h3><p>It divides and supports. It is never asked to be
          the subject of a frame.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rank-item">
        <span class="rank-n">03</span>
        <div><h3>White carries</h3><p>Whatever the blue is not doing. The largest area,
          the quietest role.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hierarchy">
      <div class="hierarchy-bar" role="img" aria-label="Area split: white 46 percent, blue 34 percent, grey 14 percent, ink 6 percent">
        <span style="background:#ffffff;flex:46;color:#5b6f78">46 % white</span>
        <span style="background:#0099cc;flex:34;color:#0a2733">34 % blue</span>
        <span style="background:#cccccc;flex:14;color:#0a2733">14 %</span>
        <span style="background:#0a2733;flex:6;color:#ffffff">6 %</span>
      </div>
      <div class="note">
        <strong>Rank is not area.</strong> Blue ranks first, but white holds the most
        surface — that is what keeps blue readable as a signal. If blue is given more than
        roughly a third of a layout it stops marking anything and becomes a background.
      </div>
      <div class="note">
        <strong>One legibility rule.</strong> White on Live Blue measures 3.3&nbsp;:&nbsp;1 —
        enough for display type at 24&nbsp;px bold and above, not enough for body copy.
        On blue surfaces, headlines are white and running text is set in Deep Ink.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="divider"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 03 TYPOGRAPHY ============ -->
  <section class="node-section shell" id="sec-3">
    <span class="node-index">03</span>
    <h2>Typography</h2>
    <p class="section-lede">
      The wordmark is drawn, not typeset. Everything around it is carried by two
      families: a geometric sans for headings and a neutral one for reading.
    </p>

    <div class="type-grid">
