          <span class="plate-label" style="left:64.8%;top:-40%">1u</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption>Construction plate — measured from the release artwork, not redrawn</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <dl class="plate-facts">
      <div class="fact"><dt>Module</dt><dd>1 u<small>Stroke weight. Constant across both words.</small></dd></div>
      <div class="fact"><dt>Cap height</dt><dd>7 u<small>x‑height 5 u · 0.71 of cap</small></dd></div>
      <div class="fact"><dt>Word gap</dt><dd>1 u<small>Technik 32.7 u · Net 17 u</small></dd></div>
      <div class="fact"><dt>Clear space</dt><dd>4 u<small>Min. width 120 px screen / 25 mm print</small></dd></div>
    </dl>
    <div class="divider"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 05 APPLICATIONS ============ -->
